{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29388","headline":"蝇蜨鸡麝鸶凤等成篇 · 李商隐","name":"蝇蜨鸡麝鸶凤等成篇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"韩蝶翻罗幕，曹蝇拂绮窗。\n鬬鸡回玉勒，融麝暖金釭。\n瑇瑁明书阁，琉璃冰酒缸。\n画楼多有主，鸾凤各双双。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29388.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29388","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}